    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>muzzle</i> a horse, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιμόω, τὸν ὀφθαλμόν</span>
			 Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1147
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>fit with the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.4
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιῷ δ᾽ ἐπὶ πολλάκι λωτῷ
				κημωθεὶς</span> (cj. Herm.for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνημωθεὶς</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> κώμους εἶχε σὺν Ἐξαμύῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermesian.
					7.38
				</span></i>
			.</div>
